# Copy to .env.local and fill it in (.env.local is not committed).

# Optional: Google Books API key, so the book search has its own quota.
# Without it the search works the same, but Google splits the quota by IP and, when it runs out,
# the search falls back to Open Library. How to create one: console.cloud.google.com >
# APIs & Services > enable "Books API" > Credentials > Create API key.
VITE_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
